        "original_id": "ef608177-4c87-5251-8c11-27415d2ca059",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: Lambic, wheat beer, Weissbier, Witbier, Berliner Weisse, Gose\n- Companies: Cantillon Brewery, Givichy Universal\n- Places: Pajottenland, Belgium, Brussels, Anderlecht\n\nFacts:\n- Cantillon Brewery was founded in 1900.\n- Cantillon Brewery is a small traditional Belgian family brewery based in Anderlecht, Brussels.\n- Lambic is a type of beer brewed in the Pajottenland region of Belgium southwest of Brussels and in Brussels itself at Cantillon Brewery.\n- Wheat beer has two main varieties, Weissbier and Witbier.\n- Wheat beer includes minor types such as Lambic, Berliner Weisse, and Gose.\n- Givichy Universal is currently located in Brussels, Belgium.",
